.TH "eternalforest-by-soulman" "6" "2026-11-14" "Eternal Forest User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
eternalforest-by-soulman - Eternal Forest, a 4k procedural graphics
executable
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]eternalforest-by-soulman\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\f[B]Eternal Forest\f[R] is a 4-kilobyte executable graphics production
(exegfx) by Soulman, released in July 2020.
It was ranked 5th in the 4k procedural graphics competition at Solskogen
2020.
.PP
A raymarched forest with a bird is rendered by a GLSL fragment shader in
a fullscreen window.
An OpenGL 4.5 capable driver is needed.
Depending on the graphics card and the resolution, the picture can take
a long time to appear, and the desktop may not respond during the
rendering.
.PP
Exit using the \f[B]Esc\f[R] key or your window manager\[cq]s close
window shortcut.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
There are no options to this program.
.SH FILES
.TP
\f[I]/usr/share/eternalforest-by-soulman/fshader.glsl\f[R]
The fragment shader, read at start-up.
